; Hilbert curve, order 5 - ONE continuous stroke, no pen lifts anywhere.
; 150.0 x 150.0 mm. Drawn RELATIVE: starts wherever the pen is and fills the
; square up and to the RIGHT. No homing and no work zero needed.
; 1023 moves of 4.8375 mm = exactly 387 microsteps each, so nothing rounds or drifts.
; Put the pen down at the BOTTOM-LEFT corner of the paper before running.
; Single stroke, so the servo is never used - tape the pen at drawing height.
